WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.426 --> 00:00:07.140
My mom is seventy-eight years old.

2
00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:13.475
She has advanced Parkinson's and
dementia and lives in assisted living.

3
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.592
Over the last few years,
the phone has turned into

4
00:00:17.593 --> 00:00:19.058
something she can't really use.

5
00:00:19.959 --> 00:00:22.270
Her hands have become slow and stiff.

6
00:00:23.097 --> 00:00:29.018
She forgets where her phone is, and more
often than not, it's not even charged.

7
00:00:29.941 --> 00:00:32.274
So people call, but they can't reach her.

8
00:00:34.189 --> 00:00:40.080
My brother and I are lucky to live close
by, so we see her a lot, but my mom's

9
00:00:40.092 --> 00:00:43.063
brother and sister live in another state.

10
00:00:44.453 --> 00:00:47.242
For them, the phone was
how they stayed in touch.

11
00:00:48.245 --> 00:00:52.786
They still try to call, but it's
gotten really hard for them to connect.

12
00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:56.737
So I'm building something for my mom.

13
00:00:57.512 --> 00:00:59.472
It's called HelloPorch.

14
00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:04.884
Think of a landline with
speed dial, but with video.

15
00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:12.219
She presses one big physical button,
and it immediately starts a video call.

16
00:01:13.457 --> 00:01:18.669
And when her siblings call her,
HelloPorch answers automatically.

17
00:01:23.127 --> 00:01:29.764
There's no phone to find, no screen
to unlock, no app to remember.

18
00:01:31.783 --> 00:01:35.471
I'm trying to make it feel
familiar with as little for

19
00:01:35.483 --> 00:01:37.032
her to figure out as possible.

20
00:01:38.671 --> 00:01:43.047
I know other families are facing
similar challenges, and I hope what I'm

21
00:01:43.048 --> 00:01:44.912
building can eventually help them too.

22
00:01:46.649 --> 00:01:50.175
I'll be sharing what I try
and what I learn as I go.

23
00:01:51.226 --> 00:01:56.028
In the meantime, if someone in your family
is finding it hard to stay in touch with

24
00:01:56.028 --> 00:01:58.250
loved ones, please send me a message.

25
00:01:58.914 --> 00:02:00.742
I'd love to see if HelloPorch can help.
